      "text": "For a **stationary isotropic kernel** (e.g. Matérn or squared‑exponential) and a **smooth target** \\(f\\) on a bounded domain \\(\\mathcal D\\),\n\n\\[\n\\boxed{\\;\\;\n\\sup_{x\\in\\mathcal D}\\bigl|f(x)-\\hat f_n(x)\\bigr|\n\\;\\le\\;\nC\\, n^{-2/(d+2)}\\;(\\log n)^{\\alpha(d)}\n\\;\\;}\n\\]\n",
      "start": 182,
