      "text": "If we **fix a maximum tolerable error** \\(\\varepsilon>0\\) ... we must choose a training‑set size \\(n\\) that satisfies  \n\n\\[\nC\\, n^{-2/(d+2)} \\le \\varepsilon\n\\qquad\\Longrightarrow\\qquad\nn \\;\\ge\\;\n\\left(\\frac{C}{\\varepsilon}\\right)^{\\frac{d+2}{2}} .\n\\]\n",
      "start": 418,
      "end": 551
